{"number":93,"name":"Ad-Dhuhaa","arabicName":"الضحى","englishTranslation":"The Morning Hours","numberOfAyahs":11,"revelationType":"Meccan","order":11,"rukus":1,"start":6079,"verses":[{"surahNumber":93,"ayahNumber":1,"arabic":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","translation":"By the bright forenoon,","juz":30,"quranLink":"https://quran.com/93/1"},{"surahNumber":93,"ayahNumber":2,"arabic":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ","translation":"and by the night when it covers the world with peace:","juz":30,"quranLink":"https://quran.com/93/2"},{"surahNumber":93,"ayahNumber":3,"arabic":"مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ","translation":"(O Prophet), your Lord has neither forsaken you, nor is He displeased.","juz":30,"quranLink":"https://quran.com/93/3"},{"surahNumber":93,"ayahNumber":4,"arabic":"وَلَلْـَٔاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌ لَّكَ مِنَ ٱلْأُولَىٰ","translation":"Indeed what is to come will be better for you than what has gone by.","juz":30,"quranLink":"https://quran.com/93/4"},{"surahNumber":93,"ayahNumber":5,"arabic":"وَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","translation":"Verily your Lord will soon give you so amply that you will be well-pleased.","juz":30,"quranLink":"https://quran.com/93/5"},{"surahNumber":93,"ayahNumber":6,"arabic":"أَلَمْ يَجِدْكَ يَتِيمًا فَـَٔاوَىٰ","translation":"Did He not find you an orphan and then gave you shelter?","juz":30,"quranLink":"https://quran.com/93/6"},{"surahNumber":93,"ayahNumber":7,"arabic":"وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآلًّا فَهَدَىٰ","translation":"Did He not find you unaware of the Right Way, and then directed you to it?","juz":30,"quranLink":"https://quran.com/93/7"},{"surahNumber":93,"ayahNumber":8,"arabic":"وَوَجَدَكَ عَآئِلًا فَأَغْنَىٰ","translation":"And did He not find you in want, and then enriched you?","juz":30,"quranLink":"https://quran.com/93/8"},{"surahNumber":93,"ayahNumber":9,"arabic":"فَأَمَّا ٱلْيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَقْهَرْ","translation":"Therefore, be not harsh with the orphan;","juz":30,"quranLink":"https://quran.com/93/9"},{"surahNumber":93,"ayahNumber":10,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا ٱلسَّآئِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْ","translation":"and chide not him who asks,","juz":30,"quranLink":"https://quran.com/93/10"},{"surahNumber":93,"ayahNumber":11,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ","translation":"and proclaim the bounty of your Lord.","juz":30,"quranLink":"https://quran.com/93/11"}]}